        "bbox": [
          92.0,
          628.0,
          856.0,
          818.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "Dehydrations of a variety of monomeric polyhydrazides to give 2,5-disubstituted 1,3,4-oxadiazoles have been studied by Stolle.  $^{1}$  We have applied this reaction quantitatively to prepare poly(1,3,4-oxadiazoles),  $^{14}$"
